   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-06-14",
   "text": "Children Don't Belong on Tobacco Farms Act\n This bill prohibits as a form of oppressive child labor the employment of any employee under age 18 who has direct contact with tobacco plants or dried tobacco leaves."
